! An optical stochastic cooling pickup and kicker with a drift and an RF cavity between them: the
! pickup reads a copy of the beam, the kicker changes delta on the host's current copy and only that
! column goes back. Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
R: RFCA, L=0.1, VOLT=2e6, PHASE=80, FREQ=2.856e9
CP: CPICKUP, ID="OSC"
CK: CKICKER, ID="OSC", STRENGTH=1e-6, LAMBDA_RAD=1e-6, NU=10, TRANSVERSE_MODE=0, INCOHERENT_MODE=0
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, CP, D, R, D, CK, D)
